<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">AROMA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Aroma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aroma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aroma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa Aroma</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwesa panga kitabu sa Roma saandikilwe na Ntumilwe Pauli mumwaka 54 na 58 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu. Mpaka po Pauli aabile anaikali Roma, kwa nyo ngatuma balua yi' kwa kitumbu sa kwaawanikia Akilisitu babaatami Roma babaayangabanike na Ayahudi na bangali Ayahudi. Aandike balua yi' abile mumuyi wa Kolinto pandu paatamage nsimu woti wo. Pauli paandike balua yi' abiniage mataipwa goti gamwu'bi'li na kunnyu'wa Yesu Kilisitu (16:26).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu si' sa Aroma nga kitabu sangama muno kwa Akilisitu ba kila pandu na kwa nsimu woti, kwa mwanjaa Pauli aawanikiye kinkati na kwa mpu'la muno bu'kana na ukosopoli, wembe twawesa kuupata kwo pi'tya Yesu Kilisitu. Kai' Pauli alu'mbaniye Injili ya Yesu Kilisitu na Lilagano lya Kwai'mbu'. Asomi baingi ba Bibilia bau'bi'lya panga nsisingwa wauyi'ma kati kitima kiku'lu' sa kitabu na waupu'twa kilombolyo soti ya kitabu, nga wu'lu' waupatikana musula 1:16 waubaya, “Nenga niibonali oni kwiala Abali Inannoga ya Yesu Kilisitu, kwa mwanjaa nga makakala ga Nnu'ngu' gagaakosopolya bandu kwa kila ywau'bi'lya, tumbulya kwa Ayahudi na kwa bangali Ayahudi.” Pandu palongoi mukitabu sa Aroma (sula 1-11) ipu'twi makowe matopau na ga nkati ya kinnu'ngu', na pandu pene bi'li' pa kitabu si' (12-15) pawanikia makowe maingi gagabu'kana na iyendo au maisa goti gagapalikwa kwa Nkilisitu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pauli mubalua yake atumbwa kwiawanikia ywembe mwene no baya panga kinyai baandikya balua <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Aandika bu'kana na ali ya kakape ya kimundu na ukosopoli wauwesa patikana pi'tya Yesu Kilisitu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 1:16-11:36">1:16-11:36</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Pauli aawanikia kwa iyendo kwa kitumbu sa maisa ga Nkilisitu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1-15:13</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Pauli ayomolya andika balua kwa Aroma kwo piya salamu kwa bandu nsi'si' bababile nkati ya kanisa lya Roma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 16">16</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Balua yi'no iandikilwe na nenga na Pauli ntumisi wa Yesu Kilisitu ywakemilwe panga ntumilwe no baulilwa kwa kitumbu sa Abali Inannoga ya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Abali Inannoga yo, Nnu'ngu' aalongoli lagana na bandu bake bu'ka kwai'mbu' kwo pi'tya alondoli bake mu Maandiko Mapeleteu. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Abali Inannoga yo, nga Abali yaibu'kana na Mwana wake. Kimundu, aabelekwi mulukolo lwa nkulungwa Daudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Kwa Loo mbeleteu, aakong'ondelilwe kwa uweso nku'lu' panga nga Mwana wa Nnu'ngu' kwo yu'yi'lwa kwake bu'ka kuuwi'li, ayu' nga Yesu Kilisitu Bwana witu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kwa ndi'la yake, Nnu'ngu' anipei ngu'ngu' yo panga nantumilwe li'nga nilongoye bandu boti bangali Ayahudi bapate kumwu'bi'lya na kunnyu'wa. Kwa likowe lyo, lina lyake lipate lumbilwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Namwenga mubile mukipi'nga sa bandu bo, mukemilwe na Nnu'ngu' li'nga mube mwabandu bake Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Nimwandikya mwaboti mwamubile Roma mwamupendilwe na Nnu'ngu' no kemelwa mube mwaapeleteu. Ninnu'bya ngu'ngu' na amani yaibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu na Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kunsukulu Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Nilongolya wi'ti' kunsukulu Nnu'ngu' wangu' kwo pi'tya Yesu Kilisitu kwa kitumbu sinu mwenga mwaboti, kwa mwanjaa abali ya imani yinu iyu'wanike mudunia yoti. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Nnu'ngu' ywanintumikia kwa mwoyo wangu' woti kwa ndi'la ya kwiala Abali Inannoga ya Mwana wake, nga nkong'ondeli wangu' panga nendakunku'mbu'kyanga. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Kila panilu'ba, ninnu'ba Nnu'ngu' mana apendile, aniyu'gu'li ndi'la ya kuntyangilyanga masu'ba gaganogano. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Kwa mwanjaa, nendaminyikia muno bonagana na mwenga, li'nga nikangamaye imani yinu kwa kumpeyanga upo ya kiloo. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Sanipala po panga, imani yinu inikangamaye nenga, na imani yangu' inkangamaye mwenga.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Mwaalongo bangu', nipala mutange panga, mala yambone nibiniage isa kasinu li'nga naute bandu mukipi'nga sinu bannyi'ki'ti Bwana kati mwanaapangite kwa bandu bi'ngi' bangali Ayahudi, lakini kila panipala yabwa, lipita likowe lya kunikanikia. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Nenga nilongelwa na bandu boti, kwa Ayunani babayendelile na kwa bangali yendelya, kwa bene ilimu na kwa bangali ilimu. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Nga po niminyikia muno kwiala Abali Inannoga kwinu mwenga mwamubile Roma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makakala ga Abali Inannoga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Nenga niibonali oni kwiala Abali Inannoga ya Yesu Kilisitu, kwa mwanjaa nga makakala ga Nnu'ngu' gagaakosopolya bandu kwa kila ywau'bi'lya, tumbulya kwa Ayahudi na kwa bangali Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Kwa mwanjaa, Abali Inannoga ilaya mu'lu' Nnu'ngu' mwaabalangilya aki bandu nnu'ngi' yake. Likowe lyo liwesekanali ila kwa ndi'la ya imani bai. Kati mu'lu' mwaiandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu gagabaya panga, <char style="qt">“Mwene aki aalama kwa ndi'la ya imani.” </char><verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' kwa bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Kwa mwanjaa, nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' ibonekine bu'ka kunani bu'kana no kotoka yu'wa na ulau woti kwa bandu babaitaukya kweli kwa ulau wabe. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Kwa mwanjaa, makowe goti gagawesa tanganikwa bu'kana na Nnu'ngu' gaumukulilwe kwabe bembe, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' mwene aagaumukwile kwabe. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Bu'ka palu' Nnu'ngu' paumbike dunia, uweso wake wa milele na unnu'ngu' wake, pamope no panga ubonekanali kwa minyo, yendatanganikwa pangali iya. Bandu bawesa kugatanga makowe go bu'kana na ikowe yaumbite Nnu'ngu'. Kwa nyo, ntu'pu' ndi'la yoyoti ya kwiiyi'mya. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Pamope no panga batangite kubile na Nnu'ngu', lakini bampeyali isima na kunsukulu kati mwaipalikwa. Mawaso gabe malalo na malango gabe gatwi'li lubi'ndu'. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Baipuna panga bene ikima, kumbe alogeloge. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Bakotwike kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu' ywalama milele, no kilikitya inyago yailandana na, inyama, iyuni, inyama yaikwaba au bandu babawaa.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Kwa kitumbu so, Nnu'ngu' aalei bakoleye maminyikio maakau ga myoyo yabe na kwipangya makowe ga oni muyi'ga yabe. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Baigalambuya kweli yaibu'kana na Nnu'ngu' kwa ubu'su', bendaisimu no kilikitya kyumbe paali pamwene ywaumbike, ywembe nga ywapalikwa alumbilwe milele! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Kwa nyo, Nnu'ngu' aalei bakoleye maminyikio gabe gagaleta oni. Ata alwawa bagalambwa matumiko gagayendana na mwabaumbilwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Nabembe analu'me nyinyonyo, bagalambwa matumiko gagabi'kilwe kwa analu'me na alwawa, kabaminyikiana analu'me kwa analu'me kabapangyana makowe ga oni. Kwa kitumbu so, baipalya bene ukumu yaibu'kana na ulau wabe.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kwa mwanjaa bandu bakani kuntanga Nnu'ngu', Nnu'ngu' nembe aalei babi'ngi'ye malango gabe go oba li'nga bapange makowe gangali pwaika kugapanga bembe. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Batwi'li sampuli yoti ya ulau, ubaya, minyikia, no sukyana. Batwi'li bwigu, ubulagi, bulwe, na ubu'su'. Bembe bandu bo songyana, balana, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />no ku'pi'ki'yana, bandu babansukya Nnu'ngu', atu'lu'lu', ambu'ku'su' na kwipuna. Bamanyi muno panga maakau, na babakotoka kwayu'wa abelei babe, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />nga alalo na bawesali u'bi'li'lwa, ntu'pu' upendo wala kiya. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Bandu bo batangite salya ya Nnu'ngu' ibaya panga, bandu babapanga makowe gano bapalikwa waa, lakini bayendelya kugapanga bai, kai' ata yi'ki'tyana na bi'ngi' babagapanga.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ukumu ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Bai, wenga wawaukumu bandu bi'ngi', ntu'pu' ndi'la ya kwikengya ata ukapangite wanyai. Kwa mwanjaa, pawaukumu bi'ngi' na wamwene kaupanga gogo, wiyi'ya wamwene muukumu. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Bai, tutangite panga ukumu ya Nnu'ngu' ya aki, kwa bandu babapanga makowe kati go. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Wenga wa mundu wawaukumu balu' babapanga go na wenga kaupanga gogo, buli! Uwasa panga waawesa kwiyepa ukumu ya Nnu'ngu'? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Au uyolou wa unogau wake, tu'ya no komeya kwa Nnu'ngu' ukubonali kili'be? Utangiteli panga unogau wake ulu'e wesa kukulongoya ata upate galambuka bu'ka musambi? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Lakini wenga wannonopau na ubile na mwoyo wangali yi'ki'tya galambuka. Kwa nyo, wibi'kya mbwatyo ngu'lu' lisu'ba lya Nnu'ngu' paalaya nyongo yake na ukumu yake ya aki. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Kwa mwanjaa, <char style="qt">Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kunni'pa kila mundu bu'kana na iyendo yake.</char> <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Bandu bi'ngi' batotokelwali panga manogau kwo pala utukupu waubu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', isima na maisa gangali alabika. Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kwapeya ukoto wangayomoka. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Lakini kwa balu' babapala makowe gabe bene na babakana kweli no bi'ngi'ya ndi'la akau, yalu'a kwatu'mbu'kya nyongo ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Kwalu'a baa na tabu na siki kwa kila yumo ywapanga maakau, tumbulya Ayahudi, bu'kapo kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Lakini kila mundu ywapanga manogau aapata utukupu, isima na amani, tumbulya Ayahudi, bu'kapo kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Kwa mwanjaa, Nnu'ngu' ammawali mundu ywoywoti.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Boti babapanga sambi pangali kwitanga salya ya Musa, baalu'a langanyika pangali ukumilwa na salya yi'lu'. Lakini boti babapanga sambi ku'no kabaitanga salya, baaukumilwa bu'kana na salya. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Kwa mwanjaa kwipi'kania salya bai, kumpangali mundu abalangilwe aki kwa Nnu'ngu', ila balu' babaiyu'wa salya na kwikamwa nga bababalangilwa aki. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Uwase kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi, bembe ntu'pu' salya ya Musa. Lakini kila pabatimisa mwaipala salya yi'lu' bu'kana na maganio ga pamwoyo wabe, bembe nga salya kwa kitumbu sabe bene, pamope no panga kwabe ntu'pu' salya yi'lu'. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Kwa mwanjaa balaya panga, malagyo ga salya gaandikilwe nkati ya myoyo yabe. Maganio gabe gendakwaukumu na mawaso gabe bene gendakwasitakya au gendakwayi'mya. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Nyo, ngamwayalu'a pitya lisu'ba li'lu' Nnu'ngu' lyaaukumu kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu, makowe ga iyo ya bandu gagaiyilwe kati mwaibaya Abali yangu' Inannoga.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayahudi na salya yabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Lingulya, manaitei wenga ukemelwa wa Nnyahudi, wiu'bi'lya salya na kwipunia panga ulu'mbine na Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />wipunia panga utangite gapendi Nnu'ngu' no tanga makowe gagapwaika, kwa mwanjaa uyi'ganilwe na salya. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Wenga wibona nga wa nnongokeyi wa kimbulibuli, na bweya kwa balu' bababile mulubi'ndu'. <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />Wenga wibona panga wamwalimu wa alalo na bangali komala, kwa mwanjaa ubile na utangi woti wa kweli kwa ayo salya. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Bai, wenga wawayi'gana bi'ngi', mboni wiyi'ganali wamwene? Wenga wauala panga mundu kaneayibe, mboni wamwene wendayiba? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Wenga waubaya panga mundu kaneapange upege, mboni wenga wamwene upanga upege? Wenga wausukya kilikitya inyago lakini wenga uyiba inyago mumayumba ga kinnu'ngu'! <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Wenga wawipunia salya, umpeya oni Nnu'ngu' kwa kwiti'kwana salya! <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Kwa nyo, kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu panga, <char style="qt">“Lina lya Nnu'ngu' litukanilwa na bandu bangali Ayahudi kwa kitumbu sa malau gamugapanga.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Inilwa kubile na pwaila mana kawiyu'wa salya, lakini mana kauti'kwana salya, inilwa kwako kupanga kwa bule. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Manaitei balu' bangali inilwa baikamwa salya yaipalikwa, buli, kotoka inilwa kwabe kwa balangilwa nsawani no inilwa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Mundu ywangali inilwa kiyi'ga lakini aiyu'wa salya, aalu'a kuukumu wenga wauti'kwana salya, pamope no panga utiinilwa na kwitanga muno salya. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Kwenda bonekana kwa panja ngo panga wa Nnyahudi wa kweli lili, wala inilwa yi'ga ngo inilwa kwa kweli lili. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Lakini Nnyahudi wa kweli, nga yu'lu' ywapanga Nnyahudi kwa nkati, no inilwa kwa kweli nga ku'lu' kwakupangika na Loo Mpeleteu nkati ya mwoyo wa mundu, kwenda ku'lu' kwakupangika kwa maandiko ga salya bai lili. Mundu ywa kubi nnya, alumbilwali na bandu, ila na mwene Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Bai, Nnyahudi abile na kikowe saku' kulikoni bandu bi'ngi'? Au inilwa kubile na pwaila gani? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Kubile na pwaila ngu'lu' muno. Wi'ti', bakamukiyilwe li'lu' liyi'gi'yo lya kweli lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ilu'e pangika buli manaitei bi'ngi' bau'bi'lili? Kotoka u'bi'lya kwabe kulu'e munaisa aminika kwa Nnu'ngu'? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ata pasene! Nnu'ngu' atanganikwe panga ywa kakape saa yoti, pamope no panga kila mundu mmu'su'. Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Kila paulongela malongelo gako ga kakape, na wenga waasinda pawasitakilwa na bandu.” </char><verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Lakini manaitei masambi gitu gakong'ondelya panga Nnu'ngu' apanga kwa aki, tubaye buli? Buli, Nnu'ngu' leta nyongo yake endaakaya? (Nilongela kati namundu ywa payi'ga.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Ata pasene! Ikapangage nnyo, Nnu'ngu' alu'e wesa buli kwiukumu dunia?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Mundu awesa laluya, “Manaitei ubu'su' wangu' uyangatia laya ukweli wa Nnu'ngu', no yongeya utukupu wake, mwanjaa namani nenga niukumilwa panga na mwene sambi?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Na twenga mwanjaa namani tukotoka baya kati mwabatuku'pi'ki'a panga tubaya, “Tupange maakau li'nga gaise manogau?” Boti babapangite, bapalikwa pata ukumu yabe.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntu'pu' mwene aki kwa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Tubaye buli? Twenga twa Ayahudi twapi'ta paku' balu' bangali Ayahudi? Twapi'tali ata kwa kili'be simo, kwa mwanjaa niyomwike laya panga Ayahudi na bangali Ayahudi, boti babile pai' ya utawala wa sambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Kati mwaiandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu panga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">
    <char style="qt">“Ntu'pu' mwene aki ata yumo. </char><verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />
    <char style="qt">Ntu'pu' mundu ywatangite makowe ga Nnu'ngu', </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">
    <char style="qt">wala ywaauka na Nnu'ngu'. </char><verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />
    <char style="qt">Boti baponangine, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">
    <char style="qt">boti baboi, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">
    <char style="qt">Ntu'pu' ywapanga manogau, ntu'pu' ata yumo. </char><verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />
    <char style="qt">Malu'pi' gabe kati masiko gangakulya, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">
    <char style="qt">ndimi yabe ilongela ubu'su', </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">
    <char style="qt">mikano yabe ipiya makowe gene sumu kati nng'ambo.</char><verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />
    <char style="qt">Nkati ya mikano yabe itwi'li lasi yaibaba. </char><verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />
    <char style="qt">Magu'lu' gabe gabutukya bulaga bandu, </char><verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />
    <char style="qt">kila kwabayenda bendaalabia no langamisa, </char><verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />
    <char style="qt">ndi'la ya amani baitangiteli. </char><verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />
    <char style="qt">Nnu'ngu' bannyogopali ata pasene.” </char><verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Bai, tutangite panga, makowe goti gagalongelelwa na salya, babakiyilwa balu' bababile pai' ya salya, li'nga kila mundu kane abe na sakwikengya na dunia yoti ibe pai' ya ukumu ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Kwa nyo, ntu'pu' ata mundu yumo ywaalu'a balangilwa aki kwa Nnu'ngu' kwa kuikota salya, kwa mwanjaa salya innyangatia mundu aitange sambi bai.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yi'ki'ti'lwa na Nnu'ngu' kwa imani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Lakini nambi'yambi', Nnu'ngu' alayite ndi'la ya kummalangilya mundu aki kwake ywembe, kwenda kwa ndi'la ya salyali. Maandiko ga salya na alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' gendakong'ondelya. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Aki yi' yaibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', ipatikana kwa imani kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu. Nnu'ngu' apanga nyo kwa boti babau'bi'lya, kwa mwanjaa apo bandu boti sawasawa, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />boti bapangite sambi no pu'ngu'ki'lwa na utukupu wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Lakini kwa ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu', boti babalangilwa aki wabule kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu Yesu ywakosopolya. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Nnu'ngu' aampiyite Yesu abe salaka ya kwaawaniya kwa ndi'la ya imani mumyai yake. Aapangite nya li'nga alaye aki yake, kwa mwanjaa kwo komeya kwake, ailekekiye yi'lu' sambi yailongoli pangilwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Aapangite nyo pala alaye aki yake nsimu wu'no, li'nga ywembe abe mwene aki na ammalangilya aki yu'lu' ywamwu'bi'lya Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Bai, kwipuna kubile kwaku'? Kubi'kilwe kuutalu. Kwa salya yaku'? Buli, kwa yi'lu' ya iyendo? Lili, ila kwa salya yi'lu' ya imani. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Kwa mwanjaa tuibona panga, mundu abalangilwa aki kwa ndi'la ya imani, kwenda kwa iyendo ya salya lili. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Buli, Nnu'ngu' ywa Ayahudi kisabe? Buli, ywembe Nnu'ngu' ata kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi? Eloo, ywembe Nnu'ngu' ywa bandu boti. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' yumo bai, aabalangilya aki balu' babainilwe kwa imani na balu' bangali inilwa kwa imani yoyoyo. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Bai, nga tubaye tuitaikwa salya kwa kitumbu sa yi'lu' imani? Lili ata pasene! Ila tuitimisa salya yaibinilwe.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lukongo lwa Bulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Bai, tubaye buli bu'kana na tati' bitu Bulaimu. <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Kwa mwanjaa, manaitei Bulaimu aabalangilwe aki kwa iyendo yake bai, aabile na kikowe sa kwipunia, lakini nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' lili. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Kwa mwanjaa Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya panga, <char style="qt">“Bulaimu aamwu'bi'li Nnu'ngu', ngabalangilwa panga mundu mwene aki nnu'ngi' yake.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Bai, mundu mana apangite kasi, liposo lyake libalangilwali panga upo, ila aki ya lyusu lyake. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Lakini kwa mundu yu'lu' ywangali u'bi'lya iyendo yake ila amwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu' ywaabalangilya aki alau, imani yake ibalangilwa panga aki. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Kati mu'lu' mwalongela Daudi, nantali yake mundu yu'lu' ywabalangilwa aki na Nnu'ngu' pangali panga kyendo sosoti.<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />
    <char style="qt">“Nantali balu' babasamilwe makosa </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">
    <char style="qt">no putilwa masambi gabe. </char><verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />
    <char style="qt">Nantali mundu yu'lu' Bwana ammalangilyali masambi gake.” </char><verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Nantali yi'no kwenda kwa bandu babainilwe bai lili, ila ata kwa bandu bangali inilwa. Kwa mwanjaa tuyomwike baya panga, <char style="qt">“Bulaimu aabalangilwe panga mwene aki kwa ndi'la ya imani yake.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Buli, pakubawi paabalangilwe ywembe panga aki? Buli, yaai balo inilwa au ainilwe? Yaabile abile balo inilwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Bulaimu aainilwe nsu'gu' yake, no inilwa kwo yaai alama yaikong'ondeli panga aayi'ki'tilwe na Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sa imani yaabile nayo paabile anainilwali. Kwa nyo, Bulaimu aapangike tati' ba balu' boti babau'bi'lile pamope no panga bai banainilwali li'nga babalangilwe aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Kai' ywembe tati' ba balu' babainilwe, lakini kwenda kwa kitumbu so inilwa bai lili, ila kwa kitumbu sa bembe baibi'ngi'ya ndi'la yi'yi'lu'yi'lu' ya imani ya tati' bitu Bulaimu pabaabile banainilwa lili.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Nnu'ngu' aannagi Bulaimu na lubelekwo lwake panga, dunia yoti ilu'e panga mali yabe. Lilagano lyo lyapangilwe kwa kitumbu sa Bulaimu aaiyu'wine salya lili, ila kwa mwanjaa aamwu'bi'li Nnu'ngu', ngayi'ki'ti'lwa panga mundu ywa aki kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Kwa mwanjaa manaitei balu' babaiyu'wa salya ngababaapokya kili'be sakilagilwe, bai, imani ipwaikali, na malagyo ga Nnu'ngu' ntu'pu' kili'be. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Kwa mwanjaa, salya iyumuya nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' kwa balu' kingayu'wa, lakini kenda ikakotoka baa salya, ti'kwana salya kulu'e baali.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Kwa nyo, lilagano liisa kwa ndi'la ya imani li'nga libe kwa ngu'ngu', na baapeyilwe lubelekwo lwa Bulaimu, kwenda kwa balu' bababile ba salya kisabeli, ila kai' kwa balu' bababile ba imani ya Bulaimu. Ywembe nga tati' bitu twenga twaboti. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Nikubi'i ube wa tati' ba mataipwa gambone.”</char> Lilagano lyo lya kakape nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' yu'lu' ywamwu'bi'lya Bulaimu, Nnu'ngu' ywayu'ya bandu bu'ka kuuwi'li, na kwa amuli yake ikowe yangalibaa yenda baa. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Bulaimu aatiu'bi'lya no pi'kanilya makowe gangali wesa u'bi'li'ka, kwa nyo ngabaa <char style="qt">tati' ba mataipwa gambone</char>. Bu'kana na mayi'gi'yo go, Nnu'ngu' ammakiye, <char style="qt">“Amo nga mwalwalu'a yoloka lubelekwo lwako.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ywembe aabile mpi'ndo ywa kunako myaka mya yimo, lakini imani yake yai ikang'alang'atya pamope no tanga panga yi'ga yake yaai kati itewaa, na nnyumbowe Sara aabile ntonga. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Lakini Bulaimu aati'kwanikeli mwoyo bu'kana na lilagano lyalagilwe na Nnu'ngu', ila imani yake yayongiye kumpeya utukupu Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Aapangite nyalu' kwa mwanjaa, aatangite kakape panga yu'lu' ywampei lilagano lyo abile na uweso wo timisa. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Kwa kitumbu so, “Aabalangilwe panga mwene aki.” <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Mayi'gi'yo ga, <char style="qt">“Gaabalangilwe kwake panga aki,”</char> gaandikilweli kwa kitumbu sa ywembe kisake, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />ila na kwitu twenga kai', Nnu'ngu' aatupeya aki twenga twatumwu'bi'lya ywembe ywankosopoli Bwana witu Yesu bu'ka kuuwi'li. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Aapiyilwe awee kwa kitumbu sa masambi gitu, nembe aayu'yilwe bu'ka mukiwo li'nga tubalangilwe aki.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Balaka ya kumwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Kwa nyo, kwa mwanjaa tuyomwike balangilwa aki kwa imani, tubile na amani na Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kwo pi'tya imani yitu, Kilisitu atuyu'gu'li nniango wo yingya mungu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' yatutama nambi'yambi', na tuu'pi'la kwa kitumbu sa liu'bi'lyo lyo panga kiselele muutukupu wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Kwenda nyinyo bai lili, ila tupulaikya kai' ngu'su'mbu' kwa mwanjaa tutangite panga ngu'su'mbu' ileta ukomeyi, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />na ukomeyi uleta aminika, no aminika ku'lu' kuleta mau'bi'lyo. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Na liu'bi'lyo li' liti'kwanali myoyo yitu, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' atumiminikiye upendo wake mumyoyo yitu kwa ndi'la ya Loo Mpeleteu ywatupeile.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Kwa mwanjaa, ata patwaabile twaakigopi, pagaatimi masu'ba gake, Kilisitu awile kwa kitumbu situ twenga twabene sambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Kakape inonwipe mundu yi'ki'tya waa kwa kitumbu sa mundu mwene aki, kwaali' mundu awesa yi'ki'tya waa kwa kitumbu sa mundu nnogamwoyo. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Lakini Nnu'ngu' akong'ondeli panga endatupenda, kwa mwanjaa patwaabile balo twabene sambi, Kilisitu aawile kwa kitumbu situ. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Kwa mwanjaa nambi'yambi' tubalangilwe aki kwa Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya myai ya Yesu Kilisitu, kwa nyo ikong'ondelya panga aalu'a tukosopolya bu'ka munyongo ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Bai, manaitei patwaabile twaandumu ba Nnu'ngu' twaawanilwe nakwe kwa ndi'la ya kiwo sa Mwana wake, kwa nyo ikong'ondelya panga mwatuawanilwa nakwe, twaakosopolelwa kwa ndi'la ya bwu'mi wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Wala ago bai lili, ila tupulaika kai' kwa Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu ywatuawaniye na Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adamu na Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Kwa ndi'la ya mundu yumo, sambi yayingi mudunia no leta kiwo. Kwa nyo, kiwo kilandile kwa bandu boti, kwa mwanjaa boti bapangite sambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Sambi yaabile padunia ata salya ya Musa ibile balo tumbwa. Lakini sambi ibalangilwali pangali baa na salya. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Lakini tumbulya nsimu wa Adamu mpaka Musa, kiwo satawalike bandu boti. Ata balu' bangali panga sambi yo ti'kwana salya ya Nnu'ngu' kati Adamu baapalikwe waa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Kwa nyo, mundu yumo Adamu, awesa landana na Kilisitu, yu'lu' ywalu'e isa pasu'gu'. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Lakini likosa lya Adamu liwesali landana na ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu'. Kwa mwanjaa, pamope no panga sambi ya mundu yumo yaaletike kiwo kwa boti, kwa kiya sa mundu yumo Yesu Kilisitu, Nnu'ngu' aayongiye boti ngu'ngu' na upo yake. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kai', upo ya Nnu'ngu' na sambi ya mundu yumo ilandanali. Kwa mwanjaa, bu'ka pa likosa lya mundu yumo, Nnu'ngu' aapiyite ukumu, lakini bu'ka pa makosa ga bandu baingi, Nnu'ngu' aapiyite upo yake ya kwabalangilya aki. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Sambi ya mundu yumo, yakipangite kiwo kitawale bandu boti, lakini kakape nambi'yambi' bandu boti bapokya ngu'ngu' yambone ya Nnu'ngu'. Babalangilwa upo ya aki kwa Nnu'ngu', na abo baalu'a tawala muukoto wangayomoka kwo pi'tya yumo ywi'ngi', Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Kwa nyo, kati mwaibile bandu boti baaukumilwe bu'kana na sambi ya mundu yumo, nyinyonyo bandu boti baabalangilwa aki kwa Nnu'ngu' no peyelwa ukoto wangayomoka, bu'kana na aki ya mundu yumo. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kati mwaibile, kwo kotoka yu'wa kwa mundu yumo, baingi baapangilwe bene sambi, nyinyonyo kwo yu'wa kwa mundu yumo, baingi baapangilwa bene aki.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Salya yaisi li'nga masambi gayongekeye, lakini paiyongekiye sambi, ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' ngaiyongekeya muno. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Kati mu'lu' sambi mwaitawala no leta kiwo, nyinyonyo na ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' itawala kwa ndi'la ya aki no leta ukoto wangayomoka kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu Bwana witu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Tutama wisowiso kwa kitumbu sa Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Tumbwelelo tubaye buli? Tuyendeli tama musambi li'nga ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' ipate yongekeya? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Nyinyoli ata pasene! Twenga tupangike kati twawaa kwa abali ya sambi. Kwa nyo, tuwesali yendelya tama kai' musambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Mutangite kakape panga, twaboti twatubatisilwe mu Kilisitu Yesu, twaalu'mbine nakwe mukiwo sake. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Patwaabatisilwe twaalu'mbine na kiwo sake no sikilwa pamope nakwe, li'nga kati mu'lu' Kilisitu mwayu'yilwe bu'ka kuuwi'li kwa utukupu wa Tati', nyinyonyo na twenga kai' tuwese tama mumaisa gayambi'.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Kwa nyo ntu'pu' kyukala, manaitei twaalu'mbine nakwe kwa ndi'la ya kiwo kati ywembe, twaalu'mbana nakwe kai' kwa ndi'la yo yu'yi'lwa kwake. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Kwa mwanjaa tutangite panga wu'lu' umundu witu wa kwai'mbu' waabambilwe pamope na Kilisitu, li'nga twakanetawalilwa na sambi no pangilwa twaabanda ba sambi kai'. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Kwa mwanjaa, mundu ywoywoti ywawile, abi'kilwe maulu bu'ka mumakakala ga sambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Bai, manaitei twaawile pamope na Kilisitu, tuu'bi'lya panga twaatama kai' pamope nakwe. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Kwa mwanjaa tutangite panga Kilisitu aayu'yilwe, nembe awesali waa kai', kwa nyo kiwo kibileli na uweso kai' kwake ywembe. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Kiwo sake saai sa mala yimo bai, li'nga kugasinda makakala ga sambi yoti, na nambi'yambi' atama mumaisa ga kumpulaisa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Nyinyonyo, mwibalangili mwawaa musambi, lakini mwabau'mi kwa Nnu'ngu' mu Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Kwa nyo, kanemwiyi'ki'ti'ye sambi itawale nkati ya yi'ga yinu yaipalikwa waa, li'nga kumpanga mugayu'we maminyikio gake. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Kanemupiye ili'mbi'li'mbi' ya yi'ga yinu itumike kati yombo yo panga sambi, ila mwipiye mwabene kwa Nnu'ngu' kati mwabandu mwamuyu'yilwe bu'ka mukiwo no yingya muukoto wayambi'. Muntumikiye Nnu'ngu', na ili'mbi'li'mbi' yoti ya yi'ga yinu ipange kasi kati yombo ya aki. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Kwa nyo, sambi yaabali na makakala kwinu mwenga, kwa mwanjaa mubileli pai' ya salya, ila pai ya ngu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Panga abanda ba aki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Tumbwele tubaye buli? Buli, tupange sambi kwa mwanjaa tubileli pai' ya salya ila pai' ya ngu'ngu'? Lili, ata pasene! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Kakape mutangite panga, mana mwipiyite mwabene panga mwaabanda no palikwa yu'wa, kakape mupanga mwaabanda ba yu'lu' ywamunnyu'wa. Manaitei ubanda wa sambi, kuundi'la yake kiwo, na manaitei ubanda wa kunnyu'wa Nnu'ngu', kuundi'la yake maisa ga aki. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Lakini Nnu'ngu' ywakunsukulu, kwa mwanjaa pamope no panga mwaabile mwaabanda ba sambi, lelo mwendayu'wa bu'ka nkati ya myoyo kwa mayi'gano gamupokile. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Mubi'kilwe ulu bu'ka muubanda wa sambi, na nambi'yambi' mugalambuki muubanda wa aki. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Nilongela mu'lu' mwaumbilwe mundu kwa kitumbu sa ukigopi wa yi'ga yinu. Kati mu'lu' mwamwiipiyite ili'mbi'li'mbi' yinu itumike na usapu na ulau li'nga mupate panga malau, nyinyonyo nambi'yambi' mwipiye ili'mbi'li'mbi' yinu itumike na aki li'nga mupate peleteyelwa na Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Pamwabile mwaabanda ba sambi, mutawalilwageli na aki. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Lakini mwapatike ki'li' kwa makowe go gamugabona ga oni nambi'yambi'? Kuundi'la wa makowe go, kiwo. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Lakini kwa mwanjaa nambi'yambi' mubi'kilwe ulu bu'ka sambi no pangilwa mwaabanda ba Nnu'ngu', pwaila yinu upeleteu wauyomokya kuukoto wangayomoka. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Kwa mwanjaa, liposo lya sambi kiwo, na kiya sa Nnu'ngu', ukoto wangayomoka bu'ka kwa Kilisitu Yesu Bwana witu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Mayi'gano ga Kikilisitu bu'ka mundoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Mwaalongo bangu', nilongela na mwenga mwamwitangite salya, panga salya intawala mundu nsimu wabaa nkoti bai. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Pano nilandanisa na mwaibaya salya ya ndoa panga, nnwawa atabilwa mundoa, nsengowe pabaa balo akalama. Lakini mana nsengowe awile, aapanga abi'kilwe ulu mundoa yo. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Kwa nyo nnwawa ywo mana aaku'nda kwa nnalu'me ywi'ngi' na nsengowe akalama aakemelwa mpege. Lakini mana nsengowe awile, aapanga ntabilweli mundoa yo, na mana aaku'nda kwa nnalu'me ywi'ngi' aakemelwali mpege. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Nyinyonyo na mwenga mwaalongo bangu', mwiwi'li salya kwa ndi'la ya yi'ga ya Kilisitu li'nga mube mwamali ya yu'lu' ywaayu'yilwe bu'ka kuuwi'li, li'nga maisa ginu gabeleye itunda inannoga kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Apo kwai'mbu' twaatawalilwe na ukigopi wa kimundu. Salya yaatupangite tuminyikiye panga sambi, na maminyikiyo go ga sambi gatawalite yi'ga yitu, na galu' gaatuleti kiwo sa kiloo. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Nambi'yambi' tubile ulu bu'ka musalya, kwa mwanjaa tuwile musalya yatwatabilwe nayo. Kwa nyo, tuntumikiali Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya salya ya kwai'mbu' yayaandikilwe, ila kwa ndi'la yayambi' yo longoyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salya na sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Buli? Tubaye panga salya nga sambi? Lili! Ikapangage ntu'pu' salya, nilu'e tangali sambi. Na ikapangage ntu'pu' salya yaibaya panga, <char style="qt">“Kaneuminyikiye kili'be sa nnyino,”</char> nilu'e tangali panga minyikiya kili'be sa nnyino panga nga sambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Lakini kwo bu'kana na salya, sambi yaapatike ndi'la yo yumuya ngolo yoti ya maminyikiyo nkati yangu'. Mwanjaa pangali salya sambi nga kili'be kiwaa. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Panaabile ninaitangali salya naapangite kati mwanipalage, lakini panaaitangite salya naakwipwi panga sambi ibile na makakala na nenga nganiwaa. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Nganiibona panga, salya yo yayaabini kuniletya ukoto yaanileti kiwo. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Kwa mwanjaa sambi yaapatike ndi'la ya salya yo, na kuniletya kiwo.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ata nyo itanganikwe panga salya nga mbeleteu, na amuli yake mbeleteu, ya aki na ngolou. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Buli, si'lu' sasabile kigolou sai kiwo sangu'? Lili! Lakini li'nga sambi itanganikwe panga sambi yaletike kiwo kasangu' kwo pi'tya si'lu' kigolou, li'nga kwa ndi'la ya salya sambi iyendeli akala munomuno.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondo nkati ya mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tutangite panga salya yaabu'kite kwa Nnu'ngu', lakini nenga namundu ywa payi'ga na nipi'mi'yilwe panga nammanda wa sambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Kakape nitangiteli sanikipanga kwa mwanjaa, salu' sanipala nikipange nikipangali, ila salu' sanikisukya ngasanikipanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Bai, mana kanipanga sanikotwike kukipenda, niyi'ki'tya panga salya yo nga ngolou. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Lakini kakape nengali nanipanga sambi, ila sambi yaitama nkati yangu'. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Kwa mwanjaa nitangite panga ntu'pu' linogau lyolyoti lyalitama nkati yangu', nilombolya ube wangu' ya kiyi'ga, mwanjaa nibaa na kilu'lu' so panga linannoga lakini nikombwali kulipanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Nipangali manogau ganigapala nigapange. Nigapanga malau galu' ganikana kugapanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Bai, manaitei kanipanga ganigakana, apo nengali nanipanga go, ila yi'lu' sambi yaitama nkati yangu'.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Kwa nyo nikwipwi panga, mana kanipala panga kikowe kinogau, niutilwa na makakala go panga kikowe kilau. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Mumwoyo wangu' ninapusika kwikota salya ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Lakini nikwipwi panga kubile na makakala gi'ngi' gagapanga kasi nkati yangu', nagembe gabile mungondo kagaku'mbwana na malango gangu'. Makakala ago gi'ngi' nga ga utawala wa sambi gaganiboywa na kunipanga nammanda wa sambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Naakibona nenga namundu nki'ba! Nyai ywaanikosopolya bu'ka muyi'ga yi'no yainiletya kiwo? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ninsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa ukosopoli wake waupangilwe kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu Bwana witu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Kwa nyo mumalango gangu' nenga nammanda wa salya ya Nnu'ngu', lakini kwa ube wangu' ya kiyi'ga, nenga nammanda wa makakala ga sambi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Tama kwa makakala ga Loo Mpeleteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Bai, nambi'yambi' ntu'pu' ukumu ya kiwo kwa mundu ywoywoti ywa Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Kwa mwanjaa makakala ga Loo gagaleta ukoti kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu Yesu gammi'kite ulu kuutalu na makakala ga sambi na kiwo. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Nnu'ngu' aalipangite likowe li'lu' lyangaliwesekana pangilwa na salya kwa kitumbu sa ukigopi wa kiyi'ga. Nnu'ngu' aantumike Mwana wake abile na yi'ga nsawani na yi'ga yitu twabene sambi, li'nga apiye yi'ga yake panga salaka kwa kitumbu so bu'ya masambi gitu. Kwo panga nyo Nnu'ngu' aaipwati sambi muyi'ga ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Nnu'ngu' aapangite nnya li'nga aki yaipatikana musalya itimi nkati yitu twenga twatukotoka tama kwa kwikoleya yi'ga, ila kwa kwikoleya Loo. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Mwanjaa balu' babatama kwa kwikoleya yi'ga, batawalilwa na maminyikio ga kiyi'ga. Lakini balu' babatama kwa kunkoleya Loo Mpeleteu batawalilwa na maminyikio ga Loo. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Manaitei maganio ginu kagalongoyelwa kiyi'ga galeta kiwo, ila mana maganio ginu kagalongoyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu galeta ukoto na amani. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Kwa mwanjaa maganio gagalongoyelwa na ukigopi wa kiyi'ga, nga nndumu wa Nnu'ngu', kwa kitumbu gaiyu'wali salya ya Nnu'ngu' na wala gakombwali kwiyu'wa. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Kwa nyo babatawalilwa na ukigopi wa kiyi'ga bakombwali kumpulaisa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Lakini mwenga mutawalilwali na mwaipala yi'ga ila Loo Mpeleteu, manaitei Loo wa Nnu'ngu' katama nkati yinu. Ywoywoti ywangali Loo wa Kilisitu, aywo ywa Kilisitu lili. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Lakini kwa mwanjaa nambi'yambi' Kilisitu atama nkati yinu, yi'ga yinu iwile kwa kitumbu sa sambi, lakini loo yinu ipanga ngoti kwa kitumbu sa aki. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Loo Mpeleteu ywatama nkati yinu nga Loo ywa Nnu'ngu' ywannyu'yite Kilisitu Yesu bu'ka kuuwi'li. Kwa nyo Nnu'ngu' alu'a kwiiyu'ya ata yi'ga yinu yaiwaa kwa makakala ga Loo Mpeleteu aywo ywatama nkati yinu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Kwa nyo mwaalongo bangu', kanetutame kwo tawalilwa na ukigopi wa kimundu kwo koleya maminyikio gake. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Kwa mwanjaa mana mwatama kwa kugakoleya maminyikio ga yi'ga mwalu'a waa, lakini mana mwaibulaga yendo ya maminyikio ga yi'ga kwa Loo, mwalu'a lama. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Boti babayi'ki'tya longoyelwa na Loo wa Nnu'ngu', nga bana ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Nnu'ngu' aampeili Loo Mpeleteu li'nga mube mwaabanda babayogopa, ila li'nga mube mwabana bake. Loo ywo nga ywatuyangatia kunkema Nnu'ngu', “Tati' bitu!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Aywo Loo mwene akong'ondelya mumyoyo yitu panga twenga twabana ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa twenga twabana ba Nnu'ngu' twaalu'a pokya ulisi wake no baa pamope na Kilisitu muulisi wo. Manaitei twaaba pamope mungu'su'mbu' yake Kilisitu, na twaaba pamope kai' muutukupu wake wawaisa.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utukupu wawaisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Nenga nibona panga ngu'su'mbu' yitu ya nsimu wu'no kili'beli landanisa na utukupu wu'lu' wawaalu'a umukulilwa kwitu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Kwa mwanjaa yumbe yoti ili'nda kwa kilu'lu' muno, nsimu Nnu'ngu' paalu'a kwaumukulya bana bake. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Kila saakiumbite Nnu'ngu' saai kipu'ngu'ki'lwa baya kwake saikali muuyomolyo wake. Ago gaapangikeli mwaipala yumbe, ila Nnu'ngu' ngaayi'ki'tiye gapite kwo lolela liu'bi'lyo lyo, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />li'nga yumbe yoti ibi'ki'lwe ulu bu'ka kuubanda waualabika no peyelwa uulu wa utukupu wa bana ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Mwanjaa tutangite panga, ata nambi'yambi' yumbe yoti yendabu'bu'la kwa lwu'ngu' kati nnwawa mwene lwu'ngu' lwo papa. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Kwenda yumbe kisabe baili, ila na twenga twatupeyilwe Loo kati kitomolelyo, nkati tuli'la kwa lwu'ngu' katuli'nda bi'ki'lwa ulu kwa yi'ga yitu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Kwa mwanjaa tubile na liu'bi'lyo bu'ka Nnu'ngu' paatukosopolile. Lakini mana saukiu'bi'lya kakibonekana, kipangali liu'bi'lyo kai'. Buli, abile mundu ywau'bi'lya pata kili'be sabile naso? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Lakini tuu'bi'lya kili'be sangali kibona, kwa nyo tukili'nda kwa kilu'lu' no komeya.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Pamope na ago, Loo Mpeleteu ngaywatuyangatia muukigopi witu, kwa mwanjaa tumanyilili lu'ba mwaipalikwa. Lakini Loo Mpeleteu mwene atulu'bya kwa Nnu'ngu' kwa lwu'ngu' no bu'bu'la kwangaliyaulika. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Naywembe Nnu'ngu' ywaipekeseni myoyo, agatangite mabinio ga Loo, kwa mwanjaa Loo aalu'bya apeleteu bu'kana na mwapendi Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Tutangite panga mumakowe goti Nnu'ngu' apanga kasi li'nga kwapeya manogau balu' babampenda. Aba nga bandu baakemite Nnu'ngu' bu'kana na mabinio gake. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Nnu'ngu' aatangite bandu bake kubile balo umbilwa kwa dunia. Abo nga baasawile babe kati mwabile Mwana wake Yesu Kilisitu. Aapangite nyo li'nga Mwana wake abe mmele mualongo baingi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Nnu'ngu' balu' baalongoli kwasawa nga balu' baakemite abalangili panga bene aki, na abo nga balu' baapei utukupu wake.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upendo wa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Bai, tubaye buli bu'kana na makowe ga? Manaitei Nnu'ngu' abile lwingo lwitu nyai ywakombwa taukana na twenga? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Nnu'ngu' aannei Mwana wake mwene, na kumpiya awee kwa kitumbu situ twaboti. Kwa nyo, manaitei aampiyite Mwana wake kwa kitumbu situ, bai aakosali ata kutupeya twenga balaka yoti, pamope na Mwana wake. <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Nyai ywakombwa kwasitakya bandu babasaulilwe na Nnu'ngu'? Ntu'pu', kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' mwene ngaywaabalangilya panga babe bene aki. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Nyai ywakombwa kwaukumu? Ntu'pu', kwa mwanjaa Kilisitu Yesu aatiwaa no yu'yi'lwa bu'ka kuuwi'li no tama kuluboko lwamalyo lwa Nnu'ngu', kai' endatulu'bya. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Nyai ywakombwa kutulekangania na upendo wa Kilisitu? Buli, tabu, au siki, au ngu'su'mbu', au njala, au buula, au maule, au kiwo? Lili, mwomwoti mwatubile, Kilisitu ayendelya kutupenda. <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Kwa kitumbu sako twendabulagilwa kila lisu'ba. Tubalangilwa kati ngondolo bo sinjilwa.” </char><verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Lakini muago goti tupata usindi ntimya pi'tya Nnu'ngu' ywaatulayite upendo wake. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Kwa mwanjaa kakape nitangite panga ntu'pu' kili'be sosoti sakiwesa kutulekangania na upendo wake, wala kiwo, wala ukoti, wala malaika au makakala gi'ngi' ga kunani, wala gagapitya nambi'yambi', wala gagaalu'a pitya nnu'ngi', wala utawala, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />ntu'pu' sakibile kunani yitu wala pai' yitu, wala kyumbe si'ngi' sosoti kiwesali kutulekangania na upendo wa Nnu'ngu' waulayite kwitu kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu Yesu Bwana witu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Nnu'ngu' na taipwa lyake lyalisawile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Nilongela ukakape sika panga nilu'mbine na Kilisitu, na nilongelali ubu'su'. Zamili yangu' kailongoyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu ikong'ondelya likowe li' kai'. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Nitwi'li usuni na maminyo gangali yomoka mumwoyo, <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />kwa kitumbu sa bandu bangu'. Abo nga alongo bangu' ba kimundu. Niminyikia kwayangatia kwo lu'ba no pokya lasi yo baulwa na Kilisitu mana ilu'e wesa kwayangatia. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Abo nga Baisilaili, bandu babaasaulilwe na Nnu'ngu' babe bana bake. Aalayite utukupu wake na aapangite malagano nabo, kai' aapei salya yake, pamope na malagano gake, na aawanikiye ndi'la ya kunkilikitya. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Baisilaili nga lubelekwo lwa kiu'ku'lu' bitu na Kilisitu aabelekwi kimundu mulubelekwo lwo. Ywembe nga nku'lu' pi'ta boti na nga Nnu'ngu' ywalumbilwa milele! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Nibayali panga lilagano lya Nnu'ngu' linatimyali. Kwa mwanjaa, Baisilaili boti lili babayi'ki'tilwe na Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />wala botili babauma mulubelekwo lwa Bulaimu panga kakape bana ba Bulaimu. Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' aannagi Bulaimu, <char style="qt">“Kwa ndi'la ya Isaki walu'a pata lubelekwo lwalwaakemelwa lwako.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Mayi'gi'yo gano galombolya panga kwenda bana botili bababelekwi kimundu kwa Bulaimu nga bana ba Nnu'ngu', ila lubelekwo lwake lwalwabu'kine na lilagano lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Lilagano lyene lyabaite, <char style="qt">“Manisa nsimu kati wu'no naalu'a isa kai', naywembe Sara aapanga abile na mwana nnalu'me.” </char><verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Kai' alyo baili, ila naywembe Rebeka ammeleki u'ku'lu' witu Isaki bana mapaga. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Mapaga bo babile balo belekwa wala panga kikowe kilau au kinogau, ila kwo laya panga Nnu'ngu' ankema mundu kati mwabini mwene, kwenda kwo bu'kana na nnyendo wa mundu li, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Nnu'ngu' ammakiye Rebeka panga, <char style="qt">“Nku'mundu alu'a kuntumikia nnunawe.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Nimpendi Yakobi, lakini Esau ninsukile.” </char><verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Buli, tubaye Nnu'ngu' ywa aki li? Lili ata pasene! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Nnu'ngu' ammakiye Musa panga, <char style="qt">“Nalu'a kummi'kya kiya yu'lu' ywanipendi kummi'kya kiya, nalu'a kunnemu yu'lu' ywanipendi kunnemu.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Kwa nyo Nnu'ngu' apangali makowe gake kwo u'bi'lya mwapala mundu au lyusu lya mundu, ila kwa kiya sake bai. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Nnu'ngu' mu Maandiko Mapeleteu ammakiye Falao panga, <char style="qt">“Naakubi'i ube wankulungwa li'nga kugalaya makakala gangu' kwa bandu pi'tya kwako, na lina lyangu' liyu'wanike mudunia yoti.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Kwa nyo Nnu'ngu' ammi'kya kiya yu'lu' ywampala, na ywi'ngi' kumpanga mwene mwoyo nnonopau kati mwapala mwene.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyongo na kiya sa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Mala yi'ngi' mwanilaluya panga, “Manaitei ibile nyo, Nnu'ngu' akombwa buli kummi'kya mundu lukoolo? Nyai ywakombwa kugakana gagapendi Nnu'ngu'?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Lakini wenga wamundu! Wenga wanyai ata ulowe kuntaukya Nnu'ngu'? <char style="qt">Buli kiteleko kiwesa kunnaluya muukuli wake panga, “Mboni uniukwi nnya?”</char> <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Buli, muukuli ntu'pu' aki yo ukwa ili'be ya utu'pi', yi'ngi' yo kolelya kwa isima na yi'ngi' yo kolelya kila lisu'ba?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Amo nga mwaibile kwa Nnu'ngu'. Aapalike kwalaya bandu nyongo yake na makakala gake, lakini aakomiye balu' babamusile babaabi'kilwe wiso langamiswa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Aapangite nyo li'nga aulaye utukupu wake nku'lu' kwa bandu baasawile pokya kiya sake. Aabi'kite wiso bu'ka kwai'mbu' panga kiselele muutukupu wake, <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />nga twenga twatukemilwe nakwe kwenda bu'ka kwa Ayahudi kisabe baili, ila ata bu'ka kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Aso Nnu'ngu' nga sakibaite mukitabu sa nnondoli wake Hosea panga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">
    <char style="qt">“Bandu bababile bangu'li, naalu'a kwakema bandu bangu'. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">
    <char style="qt">Na balu' bangali kwapenda naalu'a kwakema apendwa bangu'.</char><verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />
    <char style="qt">Palu' Nnu'ngu' paalongei kwai'mbu', ‘Mwenga mwabandu bangu'li,’ </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">
    <char style="qt">apo baakemelwa bana ba Nnu'ngu' ywai nkoti.” </char><verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Kai' nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' Isaya bu'kana na Isilaili aabaite panga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">
    <char style="qt">“Ata ikatei Baisilaili bambone kati lwangi lwa kumbwani,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">
    <char style="qt">babaakosopolelwa asene bai. </char><verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />
    <char style="qt">Bwana Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kwapeya bandu boti ba dunia </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:28">
    <char style="qt">mbwatyo yaitimile pangali si'ya kati mwaalongei.” </char><verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Kati mwabaite Isaya panga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">
    <char style="qt">“Manaitei Bwana mwene uweso woti akakotoka kwayi'ki'ti'ya bandu asene balame, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">
    <char style="qt">tupelepanga tulangamiswe muno, kati ilambo ndau ya Sodoma na Gomola.” </char><verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isilaili na Abali Inannoga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Kwa nyo aga goti galombolya namani? Tubaye panga, bandu bangali Ayahudi baakasineli panga aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', lakini Nnu'ngu' aabalangili panga bene aki kwa kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Baisilaili baakasine kwikamwa salya ya Musa li'nga babalangilwe bene aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', lakini baakombwili. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Kwa mwanjaa buli bakotwike balangilwa bene aki kwa Nnu'ngu'? Kwa mwanjaa baau'bi'li yendo yabe na baamwu'bi'li lili Kilisitu. Kilisitu nga liwe li'lu' lyabaaku'bile, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />kati mwaiandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">
    <char style="qt">“Lola, nibi'ka liwe mu Sayuni. Liwe lyo nga li'lu' lyabaliku'bala bandu, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">
    <char style="qt">na mpi'mbi' wa kwatu'mbu'ya bandu. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">
    <char style="qt">Lakini mundu ywamwu'bi'lya ywo aaibonali oni.” </char><verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Mwaalongo bangu', kilu'lu' sangu' no lu'ba kwangu' kwa Nnu'ngu', nipala panga Baisilaili bakosopolelwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Kwa mwanjaa, nikong'ondelya panga bendabinia munomuno kwipiya kwa kuntumikia Nnu'ngu', lakini banaikwipwali ndi'la ya kakape. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Bembe baaitangiteli ndi'la ya Nnu'ngu' yaabalangilya bandu aki na baaibi'ngi'yiteli, ila baapalike kwipata aki kwa ndi'la ya kwiyu'wa amuli ya Musa. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Salya yaaikite kuundi'la yake palu' Kilisitu paayomoli mabinio gake. Nambi'yambi' kila ywamwu'bi'lya abalangilwa aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukomboli kwa boti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Musa aandike bu'kana no balangilwa aki kwa kwiyu'wa salya kabaya, <char style="qt">“Kila mundu ywaiyu'wa salya aalama kwa kwikamwa salya yo.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Lakini yi'lu' aki yaipatikana muimani ibaya nnyinya, <char style="qt">“Kaneubaye mumwoyo wako, ‘Nga nyai ywaalu'a u'bu'ka kunani?’”</char> (yani li'nga kunneta Kilisitu pai'.) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />“Au <char style="qt">‘Nyai ywaalu'a elya yenda kumambi'?’”</char> (yani li'nga kunneta Kilisitu bu'ka kumambi'.) <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Amo nga mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu panga, <char style="qt">“Liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' libile papipi nawe, libile munkano wako na pamwoyo wako,”</char> (yani nga galu' mayi'gano ga imani gatugaala.) <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Mana wayi'ki'tya kwo longela pankano wako panga, “Yesu nga Bwana,” no u'bi'lya pamwoyo wako panga Nnu'ngu' aannyu'yite bu'ka kumambi', walu'a kosopolelwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Mwanjaa, kwa mwoyo mundu endau'bi'lya no balangilwa aki, kai' kwa nkano endalongela no yi'ki'tya, na kwa nyo pata ukosopoli. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Mundu ywoywoti ywaalu'a kumwu'bi'lya katu aaisikali.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Bai, ntu'pu' ubauli kati ya Ayahudi na bangali Ayahudi, mwanjaa ywembe nga Bwana wa boti, na nnogau kwa bandu boti babannu'ba. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Kwa mwanjaa, <char style="qt">“Kila mundu ywankema Bwana li'nga yangatiyilwa aalu'a kosopolelwa.”</char><verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Bai, balu'a kunkema buli yu'lu' ywabakotwike kumwu'bi'lya? Kai' balu'a kumwu'bi'lya buli manaitei banaiyu'wali abali yake? Na balu'a kwiyu'wa buli abali yake manaitei ntu'pu' ywa kwaalya? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Na balu'a ala buli mana banatumilwali? Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Lola, mwagagolwike magu'lu' gabe balu' babaala Abali Inannoga.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Lakini bandu botili babapoki Abali yo Inannoga. Na aso nga kitumbu sa Isaya baya panga, <char style="qt">“Bwana, nyai ywagau'bi'li galu' gatwaawanikiye?”</char> <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Kwa nyo imani ipatikana kwo yu'wa Abali Inannoga. Na bandu baiyu'wa Abali Inannoga pansimu waala mundu bu'kana na Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Lakini nendalaluya, “Buli bandu bo baaiyu'wine Abali Inannoga?” Eloo kakape baayu'wine, kwa mwanjaa Maandiko gabaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">
    <char style="qt">“Malobe gabe gaatipita no yu'wanika padunia yoti. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">
    <char style="qt">Mayi'gi'yo gabe gayu'wanike kila pandu mudunia yoti.” </char><verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Nilaluya liswali li'ngi', “Buli bandu ba Isilaili baatangite?” Eloo, baatangite. Nnu'ngu' aalongoli longela ga kwo pitya Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">
    <char style="qt">“Naalu'a kumpanga mwabi'ki bwigu </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">
    <char style="qt">kwo pi'tya bandu bangali nni'ma. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">
    <char style="qt">Naalu'a kumpanga mwakasiliki, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">
    <char style="qt">kwo pi'tya abo bangalitanga sosoti.” </char><verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Kai', Isaya aabaite kwa ukangamau paali pa Nnu'ngu' panga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">
    <char style="qt">“Bandu babakotwike kunipala nga babanipatike. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">
    <char style="qt">Na bandu bangali nilalukia abali yangu', nga baniilayite kasabe.” </char><verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Lakini bu'kana na bandu ba Isilaili Nnu'ngu' aatibaya panga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">
    <char style="qt">“Masu'ba goti napalite sikisana na bandu bangu', </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">
    <char style="qt">lakini bembe ambu'ku'su' na bakani kuniyu'wa.” </char><verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Kiya sa Nnu'ngu' kwa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Bai nilaluya panga, buli, Nnu'ngu' aatekwakana bandu bake? Lili ata pasene! Nenga namwene nga na Mwisilaili bu'ka mulubelekwo lwa Bulaimu, na mulukolo lwa Benyamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Nnu'ngu' aakanili bandu bake baasawile bu'ka kwai'mbu'. Buli, mwendaku'mbu'kya mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu bu'kana na Elia, nsimu waanku'ku'li'ki Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sa Isilaili? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" /><char style="qt">“Bwana, bandu ba baabulige alondoli bako na basengwaniye ibi'ki'lyo yako. Nenga kisangu' bai naniigali nankoto, na kai' bapala kunibulaga.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Lakini Nnu'ngu' annyangwi ki'li'? Ngammakia panga, <char style="qt">“Niibi'kile bandu elupu saba babakani kunkilikitya nnu'ngu' Baali.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Ata nambi'yambi' nyinyonyo baigali Baisilaili asene bai babaasaulilwe na Nnu'ngu' kwa ngu'ngu' yake. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Baasaulilwe kwa ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu', kwenda kwa iyendo yabe lili. Ikapangage baasaulilwe kwa iyendo, bai ngu'ngu' ilu'e pangali ngu'ngu' kai'.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Kwa nyo, Baisilaili baapalike panga bene aki kwa Nnu'ngu', lakini baapatikeli. Ila balu' bai babasaulilwe na Nnu'ngu' nga babaapatike. Bi'ngi' boti babaigile, Nnu'ngu' aapangite babe na myoyo minonopau. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu panga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">
    <char style="qt">“Nnu'ngu' aapangite babe kati bandu babalobi lugono, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">
    <char style="qt">na aawiliwitiye minyo li'nga kanebabone, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">
    <char style="qt">kai' aaibike makutu li'nga kane bayu'we. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">
    <char style="qt">Amo ngamwababile ata li'no.” </char><verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Naywembe Daudi abaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">
    <char style="qt">“Makalamu gabe gapange kitapa so kola, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">
    <char style="qt">batu'mbu'ke no pwatilwa. </char><verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />
    <char style="qt">Minyo gabe gayi'yilwe lubi'ndu' li'nga </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">
    <char style="qt">kanebakombwe bona. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">
    <char style="qt">Migongo yabe iunjame masu'ba goti, kwo topelwa na igombo ya tabu yabe.” </char><verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Bai, nambi'yambi' nilaluya panga, Baisilaili baatiku'bala li'nga batu'mbu'ke no langanyika munomuno? Lili, ata pasene! Ila, kwo bu'kana no ku'bala kwabe, ukosopoli waisili bandu bangali Ayahudi. Mabinio gano ga Nnu'ngu', gabile ga kwaapanga Ayahudi babe na bwigu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Manaitei bandu bangali Ayahudi baapatike ngu'ngu' ngu'lu' kwa kitumbu so ku'bala kwa Ayahudi, bai, baalu'a pata ngu'ngu' ngu'lu' muno palu' Ayahudi boti pabaapangika bandu ba lukolo lwapala Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukosopoli wa bandu bangali Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Bai, nilongela na mwenga mwabandu bangali Ayahudi, panga nenga nga nanitumilwe na Nnu'ngu' nibe nantumilwe kwa balu' bangali Ayahudi. Nilu'a panga kwo binia muno kwiisimu kasi yangu'. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Kwa nyo nipi'kanilya kwapanga bandu bangu' babe na bwigu. Kwa ndi'la yo yendawesekana kwayangatia Ayahudi bi'ngi' babe, bakosopolelwe. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Kwa nyo manaitei kanilwa kwa Ayahudi na Nnu'ngu' kwaipangite dunia iawanilwe na ywembe, bai, yi'ki'ti'lwa kwabe, kwaalu'a panga ukoti bu'ka kuuwi'li.<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Manaitei mundu kampikia Nnu'ngu' mili'mbu' ya ilalyo yake, bai ilalyo yoti yapanga kwa kitumbu sa Nnu'ngu'. Kai', manaitei ngi'ga ya nkongo ipeletike, na ndambi' yake yapanga mbeleteu. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Lakini manaitei ndambi' ya nkongo wa munng'unda yaatikatilwa no namatika ndambi' ya nkongo wa mmwitu paali pake li'nga ulu'lu' wake ulye pamope na ndambi' ya muliina. Mwenga lelo nga mwandambi' ya nkongo wa mmwitu. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Kwa nyo kanemuisalawe ndambi' yayaakatilwe. Kanemwipune, muku'mbu'ki panga mwengali mwamulilisa liina, ila liina ngalinnisa mwenga.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Mala yi'ngi' walu'a baya panga, “Ndambi' yaakatilwe kwa kitumbu sangu' li'nga ninamatikilwe paali pake.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Likowe lyo lya kakape. Ndambi' yo yaakatilwe kwa kitumbu so kotoka u'bi'lya, na wenga ubile kati mwaubile kwa mwanjaa wendau'bi'lya. Kwa nyo kanewipune, ila uyi'me kwo yogopa. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Manaitei Nnu'ngu' aaibi'kili kiya ndambi' ya kibelekwe, wala wenga aalu'a kubi'kyali kiya. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Lola Nnu'ngu' apangya bi'ngi' manogau, bi'ngi' aapwatya kwa ukali'. Aapwatya kwa ukali' balu' babakana kumwu'bi'lya, na apangya manogau babayendelya kumwu'bi'lya. Lakini mana mwaakotoka kumwu'bi'lya mwaakatilwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Manaitei Ayahudi bo baagalambuka na kumwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu', baalu'a namatikilwa kai' munkongo wabe, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' abile na uweso wa kwanamatika kai'. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Lakini mwenga mwangali Ayahudi mubile kati lutambi' lwalukatilwe bu'ka munkongo wa mmwitu, na mwaanamatikilwe na nkongo wa munng'unda. Lakini Ayahudi nga kati ndambi' yaibu'kana na nkongo wa munng'unda. Kwa nyo, buyangania ndambi' munkongo wake wa kibelekwe kai', inonopali.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kosopolelwa kwa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Mwaalongo bangu', mbala mutange ukweli gu' wauiyilwe li'nga mwakane kwiibona mwabene malango muno. Umbu'ku'su' wa Ayahudi waabile pasene bai, likowe li' lyaagalambuka palu' isabu ya bandu bangali Ayahudi payaalu'a timya li'nga pokya ukosopoli wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Kwa ndi'la yo, Baisilaili boti baalu'a kosopolelwa. Kati mwaiandikilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">
    <char style="qt">“Nkomboli aalu'a isa bu'ka Sayuni, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">
    <char style="qt">aalu'a kuubu'ya ulau wa lubelekwo lwa Yakobi. </char><verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />
    <char style="qt">Li'no nga lilagano lyanalu'a kulipanga nabo </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">
    <char style="qt">nsimu panaalu'a kwasamya masambi gabe.” </char><verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Kwa nambi'yambi' Ayahudi babakana kwipokya Abali Inannoga bapangike andumu ba Nnu'ngu'. Likowe li' lipitike li'nga limpwaike mwenga mwangali Ayahudi. Lakini balo panga Ayahudi asaulilwa na Nnu'ngu', na endakwapenda kwa kitumbu sa malagano gaagabi'i kwa akinatati' babe. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Nnu'ngu' mana aasawile bandu bake na kwayalya, akombwali galambuka. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Kwai'mbu' mwenga mwannyu'wineli Nnu'ngu', ila nambi'yambi' mupoki kiya sa Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa Baisilaili bannyu'wineli. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Nyinyonyo ngamwailu'a panga kwabe. Nambi'yambi' bannyu'wali Nnu'ngu', lakini baalu'a pokya kai' kiya sa Nnu'ngu' kwa mwanjaa, baalu'a kwibona ndi'la yamupokeli mwenga kiya sake. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Nnu'ngu' antabi kila yumo muutabilwe wo kotoka yu'wa. Lakini apangite nyo kwa kitumbu so laya kiya sake kwa boti.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnu'ngu' alumbilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Eloo, utayili wa Nnu'ngu' nga nku'lu' muno! Ikima na utangi wake ntu'pu' uyomokyo! Ntu'pu' ywakombwa awanikia galu' gagaamwa Nnu'ngu', na ntu'pu' ywakombwa tanga mali'la gake! Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu,<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />
    <char style="qt">“Nyai ywapatike kugatanga maganio ga Bwana? </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">
    <char style="qt">Nyai ywawesa tama kitamo simo na Nnu'ngu'?” </char><verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />
    <char style="qt">“Au nyai ywaalongoli wi'ti' kumpeya Nnu'ngu' kili'be,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">
    <char style="qt">ata awese li'pi'lwa kai' kili'be so?” </char><verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Eloo, Nnu'ngu' nga ywaumbite ili'be yoti. Na kila kili'be kiyendelya baa kwa ndi'la yake na kwa kitumbu sa ywembe. Utukupu ube kwa Nnu'ngu' milele yoti! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Maisa muutumisi wa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Kwa nyo mwaalongo bangu', kwa kitumbu sa kiya sake Nnu'ngu', nendakunnu'ba mwipiye yi'ga yinu ibe salaka yaibile ngoti, mbeleteu na yainnogelelya Nnu'ngu'. Yi'no nga ibala yinu ya ngama. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Kanemwiikoteye kai' iyendo ya dunia yi'no, ila mugalambuyilwe myoyo yinu kwo pangilwa mwabayambi'. Apo nga pamwawesa tanga mwapendi Nnu'ngu' na kugakong'ondelya gagabile manogau, gagannogelelya Nnu'ngu' kai' gagatimilike.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Kwa kitumbu sa ngu'ngu' yanipeyilwe nimmakia kila yumo ywinu, kaneaiwase panga ywa ngama kulikoni mwapalikwa, ila apalikwa abe ntu'ya kwo li'ngana na kili'ngo sa imani sapeyilwe kila mundu na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Kati mu'lu' mwamutangite, yi'ga yimo, lakini ibile na ili'mbi'li'mbi' yambone, na kila kili'mbi'li'mbi' kibile na kasi yake. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Nyinyonyo na twenga twatubile twabaingi, tubile na yi'ga yimo mu Kilisitu, na kila yumo ywitu nga kili'mbi'li'mbi' sa nnyine. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Kwa nyo tubile na upo mbali'mbali' kila yumo bu'kana na ngu'ngu' yatupeyilwe. Ywabile na upo ya ulondoli, atumi upo yo bu'kana na imani yake. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Ywabile na upo ya utumisi na atumike, na ywabile na upo yo yi'gana na ayi'gane. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Ywabile na upo ya kwakamwamboko bi'ngi' na apange nyo, na ywabile na upo ya kwayangatia apaali, apange nyo wiso, ywabile na upo yo yi'mya bandu, ayi'mi bandu kwo binia. Na mundu ywabile na upo ya kwabi'kya kiya bandu, bai apange nyo kwo napusika.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mupendane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Pendana kwinu kanekubee kwa unapiki, muusuki ulau. Mupange gagabile manogau bai. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Mupendane mwabene na bene kati mwaalongo, kila mundu akasane kumwisimu nnyine. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Kanemube mwaakata kwo panga lyengo lya Bwana, ila Loo Mpeleteu annyangatiye yendelya panga lyengo lyo kwa mwoyo woti. Muntumikiye Bwana Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Mupulaike kwa kitumbu sa mau'bi'lyo gamubile nago, mukomeye pamukwembana na siki, na muyendeli kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Mwayangatiye aumini ainu muili'be yabapu'ngu'kilwe, na mube mwabandu ba kwakemya ageni mumayumba ginu.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Mwalu'bi balaka balu' babantesa, mwalu'bi balaka kwenda lasi lili. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Munapusike pamope na babanapusika na muli'le pamope na babali'la. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Mutame kwa amani mwabene na bene, kanemwipune ila mube na kiselele na bandu bababonekana bangamali kwa bandu bi'ngi'. Kanemwibalangili panga mubile na malango pi'ta bandu bi'ngi' boti.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Mundu mana akukosile, kaneupale kummukiya, mubini panga galu' gagabile manogau kwa kila mundu. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Mwikase panga lyolyoti lyamuliwesa, li'nga mube na amani na bandu boti. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Mwaalongo bangu', kanemubukiye, ila munneki Nnu'ngu' likowe lyo. Kwa mwanjaa Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya nnyinya, <char style="qt">“Bu'kana no bukiya, nenga nilu'a bukiya.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Kai' bu'kana no kotoka bukiya, Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">
    <char style="qt">“Mana nndumu ywako abile na njala, umpei kilyo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">
    <char style="qt">na mana abile na nnyota umpei kinywo. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">
    <char style="qt">Kwo panga nyo waapanga unkalile makala ga mwoto pantwe wake.” </char><verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Kaneuyi'ki'ti sindilwa na ulau, ila uusinde ulau kwa unogau.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kwayu'wa alongosi ba nni'ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Kila mundu apalikwa kwayu'wa atawala ba silikali, kwa mwanjaa utawala woti ubu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', na wembe ubi'kilwe na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Kwa nyo ywataukana na utawala wa silikali, aywo aitaukya amuli ya Nnu'ngu', na babapanga nyo bailetya ukumu bene. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Kwa mwanjaa babapanga manogau baayogopali atawala, ila kwa balu' babapanga maakau bai. Kwa nyo mana kokana kwayogopa atawala upange makowe ganannoga, na bembe baalu'a kulumba. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ntawala wa silikali nga ntumisi wa Nnu'ngu', na lyengo lyapanga lya pwaila yinu mwabene. Lakini mana upangite maakau, upalikwa yogopa! Kakape panga abile nawo uweso wo ukumu. Ywembe apanga ntumisi ywa Nnu'ngu', kwa kwaukumu balu' babapanga malau. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Kwa nyo mpalikwa kwayu'wa atawala ba silikali, kwenda kwa kitumbu so yogopa ukumu baili, ila kai' kwa kitumbu sa zamili kaneikuauye.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Kwa kitumbu so muli'pe koli, kwa mwanjaa atawala nga atumisi ba Nnu'ngu', babatumya masaa gambone kuntumikia mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Mumpei kila mundu aki yake. Ywalonga koli yoyoti ali'pi'lwe, mundu ywapalikwa isimilwa aisimilwe.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pendana kwa bandu boti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Kanemube na lileni kwa mundu ywoywoti, ila mupendane, kwa mwanjaa yu'lu' ywampenda nnyine atimisa salya. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Kwa mwanjaa amuli yi' yaibaya, <char style="qt">“Kaneupange upege, kaneubulage, kaneuyibe, kaneuminyikiye,”</char> na amuli yi'ngi' yoti, iyongeyelwa muamuli ayi' yimo, <char style="qt">“Umpende ywapapipi yako kati mwawipenda wamwene.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Mundu ywampenda ywapapipi yake awesali kumpangya ulau. Kwa nyo upendo nga ndi'la yo timisa salya ya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Na mwenga mupange nya, ku'no kamuukwipwa nsimu watubile nawo. Saa yo yumuka bu'ka mulugono iikite, kwa mwanjaa nambi'yambi' ukosopoli witu wi pipi muno kulikoni patumbu patwaau'bi'lile. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Kilo kiyendelile muno na muntwekati kwendaegelya. Bai tugataikuli kuutalu makowe goti ga lubi'ndu', na tuwale ingondwa ya bweya. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Tutame kati mwaipalikwa kwa wakati wa muntwekati, na kwenda kwo mila no lobya, usapu na upege, nnomo na bwigu li. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Bai Bwana Yesu Kilisitu abe kiwalo sinu, kanemwiauye kai' na maminyikio ga yi'ga yinu yene ali ya sambi.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Kaneumukumu nnongogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Munkemi mumini nnyinu ywangalikomala muimani yake. Kanemutaukane nakwe bu'kana na maganio gake. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Mundu mwene imani yaikomile endakombwa lya kila kili'be, lakini ywangalikomala muimani, alya likolo bai. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Yu'lu' ywalya kila kili'be kaneansalawe yu'lu' ywakotoka lya, wala yu'lu' ywakotoka lya kila kili'be kaneamukumu yu'lu' ywalya kila kili'be, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' annyi'ki'tile. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Wenga wa nyai ata umukumu ntumisi wa ywi'ngi'? Mana ayi'ma wiso mulyengo lyake au mana atu'mbu'ka, alyo lyaaba mmoko ga bwana wake. Na ywembe aalu'a yi'ma wiso kwa mwanjaa Bwana abile na uweso wa kunnyi'mi'ka.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Bandu bi'ngi' bawesa balanga panga lisu'ba limo nga lya ngama muno kuliko li'ngi'. Na bi'ngi' babalanga panga masu'ba goti gabile nsawani. Kila mundu apalikwa panga kati mwaalu'a kwibona mwene panga nga kakape. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Mundu ywabalanga panga lisu'ba limo nga lya ngama kulikoni li'ngi', apanga nyo kwa kitumbu sa kunkwi'ya Nnu'ngu'. Na ywalya kila kilyo, apanga nyo kwa kitumbu sa kunkwi'ya Bwana mwanjaa ansukulu Nnu'ngu'. Na ywakotoka lya kila kilyo, nyinyonyo apanga nyo kwa kitumbu sa kunkwi'ya Bwana na kunsukulu Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Kwa mwanjaa ntu'pu' ata yumo ywitu ywatama kwa kitumbu sake mwene, wala ntu'pu' ata yumo ywitu ywawaa kwa kitumbu sake mwene. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Mana katulama, tulama kwa kitumbu sa Bwana, na mana tuwile, tuwaa kwa kitumbu sa Bwana. Kwa nyo, lama au waa, twenga nga mali ya Bwana. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Kilisitu aatiwaa no yu'ka, li'nga abe Bwana wa bandu boti, yani ywa babawile na bababile bau'mi. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Tumbwe lelo mwanjaa namani wenga umukumu nnongogo? Au kwa ki'li' wenga unsalawa nnongogo? Kwa mwanjaa twenga twaboti twaalu'a yi'ma nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa ukumu sa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Kati Maandiko Mapeleteu mwagabaya, <char style="qt">“Kakape Bwana abaya, kila mundu alu'a nikilikitya, na kila yumo aalu'a baya panga nenga nga na Nnu'ngu'.” </char> <verse eid="ROM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" /><char style="qt">Kwa nyo, kila yumo ywinu aalu'a awanikia makowe gake mwene nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. </char><verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaneunku'baye nnongogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Kwa nyo tukotoke ukumiana, paali pake tubini leka panga sosoti sasaalu'a kumpanga aku'bale au kuntu'mbu'ya muumini nnyitu. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Bu'kana na mayi'gano ga Bwana Yesu, kakape nitangite panga ntu'pu' kilyo sakibile kisapu kwa kibelekwe sake. Lakini mana mwene mundu kakibona panga kisapu, bai kwake ywembe kili'be so, kisapu. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Mana wenga kaumpanga nnongogo ausunike bu'kana na kilyo so lya, bai iyendo yako ibu'kanali na upendo. Bai kaneuyi'ki'ti kumwobeya mundu ywa Kilisitu kwa kilyo saulya. Kwa mwanjaa, Kilisitu aawile kwa kitumbu sake. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Mana kaukibona kili'be si' kinogau, kaneuyi'ki'ti kibayilwe kilau. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Kwa mwanjaa ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' kwenda wo lya no nywa lili, ila wa aki, amani no napusika kwakupiyilwa na Loo Mpeleteu. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Kwa mwanjaa mundu ywoywoti ywantumikia Kilisitu kwa ndi'la yi' apanga mwapala Nnu'ngu' no yi'ki'ti'lwa na bandu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Kwa nyo twikase muno panga makowe galu' gagaleta amani na gagatuyangatia sengana muimani. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Kaneualabiye lyengo lya Nnu'ngu' bu'kana na kilyo. Kakape ilyo yoti inogite, lakini ipwaikali lya kili'be sosoti sakimpangiya nnongogo aku'bale. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Nantali kotoka lya nnyama wala nywa divai au panga likowe li'ngi' lyolyoti lyalyaalu'a kumpangia nnongogo aku'bale. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Bai si'lu' saukiu'bi'lya bu'kana na likowe lyo, kibe kwako wenga na Nnu'ngu' bai. Nantali mundu yu'lu' ywangali ba na kitumbu sa kwiukumu pamoyo wake papanga kili'be na kukibona panga kibile sawasawa. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Lakini mana mundu abile na kyenyo bu'kana na si'lu' kilyo salya, aywo aukumilwa na Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa mundu ywo apangite si'lu' sau'bi'lya nga kisapu nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. Mana mundu kapanga sosoti sakotoka u'bi'lya panga nga sawasawa, apo nga paapanga sambi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Muleke makowe ga kwipenda mwabene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Bai twenga twatukomile muimani, tupalikwa kuupu'twa ukigopi wa aitu bangali komala. Twaayangatie muukigopi wabe na kanetupange makowe gagatunogelelya twenga twabene bai. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Kwa kila yumo ywitu apalikwa kunnogelelya ywapapipi yake kwa makowe goti manogau, li'nga kunkangamaya muimani. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Kwa mwanjaa ata Kilisitu mwene aapangiteli makowe gakunnogelelya mwene, ila kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Matukano gabe gabaakutukine wenga, gaanipatike na nenga.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Kwa mwanjaa kila kili'be sasaandikilwe kwai'mbu' mu Maandiko Mapeleteu, saandikilwe kwa kitumbu sa kutuyi'gana twenga. Maandiko go gatuyangatia komeya tabu yitu na gatukamwamboko, li'nga tube na liu'bi'lyo. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nnu'ngu' ywai nsingi wa ukomeyi na mboko anyalyange mwenga li'nga mubini limo bu'kana na Kilisitu Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />li'nga mwenga mwaboti kwo binia limo na kwa lilobe limo, munkwi'ye Nnu'ngu', Tati' ba Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abali Inannoga kwa bandu boti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Mukemyane mwabene na bene kati Kilisitu mwaankemi mwenga li'nga kunnetya Nnu'ngu' utukupu. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Kwa mwanjaa nimmakia panga, Kilisitu aaisi baa ntumisi ywa Ayahudi, li'nga kwalaya panga Nnu'ngu' kakape nga ywo u'bi'li'ka. Kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu, Nnu'ngu' atimisike malagano goti gabalagilwe au'ku' babe, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />kai' aaisi li'nga bandu bangali Ayahudi bapate kunkwi'ya Nnu'ngu' kwa kiya sake. Kati mwaiandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Kwa nyo nilu'a kunnumba mukipi'nga sa bandu bangali Ayahudi, nilu'a kwiyi'mba sipwa ya lina lyako.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Kai' Maandiko gabaya, <char style="qt">“Mupulaike mwabandu bangali Ayahudi, mupulaike pamope na bandu bake.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Kai', <char style="qt">“Mwenga mwamataipwa goti, munnumbe Bwana, mwenga mwabandu boti, munnumbe.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Kai' Isaya abaya, <char style="qt">“Mundu yumo mulukolo lwa Yese aalu'a pitya, aalu'a kwatawala bandu ba mataipwa, na bembe baalu'a kumwu'bi'lya.” </char><verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Bai Nnu'ngu' ywaleta mau'bi'lyo, antwi'li'ye pulaa yoti na amani bu'kana na imani yinu, li'nga mau'bi'lyo ginu gapate yongekeya kwa makakala ga Loo Mpeleteu.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utumisi wa Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Mwaalongo bangu', nenga namwene nitangite kakape panga, mwenga mwabandu anogau na mwabene malango muno, kai' mwendawesa yi'ganana mwabene na bene. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Lakini mubalua yi', nimwandiki makowe gi'ngi' pangali bwoga, li'nga ninku'mbu'ki'ye makowe go. Nipangite nyo bu'kana na ngu'ngu' yaniyali Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />li'nga nipange na ntumisi wa Kilisitu Yesu kwa kitumbu sa bandu bangali Ayahudi. Nikamukiyilwe lyengo lya utumisi wa Abali Inannoga yaibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', li'nga bapate ba salaka yaiyi'ki'tilwe na Nnu'ngu', yaipeleteyilwe na Loo Mpeleteu. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Kwa nyo, bu'kana no lu'mbana na Kilisitu Yesu, niwesa baya nendakwilumba panintumikia Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Kwa mwanjaa nilowali baya kili'be sosoti si'lu' ila si'lu' bai Kilisitu saapangite kwa kunitumikia nenga, li'nga bandu bangali Ayahudi bapate yu'wa kwa galu' ganilongei no panga. <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />Naapangite myasu na mangelongelo kwa uweso wa Loo wa Nnu'ngu'. Kwa nyo, tumbulya Yelusalemu mpaka kunkoa wa Iluliko, niialike wisowiso Abali Inannoga ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Kwa nyo mabinio gangu' nilu'a ala Abali Inannoga pandu pangali alilwa abali ya Yesu, li'nga naakane bwi'li'gi'ya pandu papayomwike alilwa na mundu ywi'ngi'. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Bandu bangali bakiyilwa abali yake baalu'a bona, na balu' bangalipata yu'wa, baalu'a tanga.” </char><verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpango wa Pauli wo tyangilya Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Kwa kitumbu so nganaibilwe kwa mala yambone isa kasinu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Lakini nambi'yambi' niyomwile lyengo lyangu' mulwingo lwoti lwa nni'ma wu', na kwa myaka yambone namminyikiye isa kasinu, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />kwa nyo naalu'a kuntyangilya mumwanja wangu' wo yenda Spania. Bu'ka po pulaika pamope na mwenga, nannu'ba muniyabuye mumwanja wangu' wa Spania. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Nambi'yambi' nibile mumwanja woyenda Yelusalemu kwa kitumbu sa kwayangatia apeleteu ba akwo. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Kwa mwanjaa makanisa ga Makedonia na Akaya gaamwile piya nsango wabe, li'nga kwayangatia bandu ba Nnu'ngu' bababile aki'ba akwo Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Baapulaike panga nyo. Na yaabile kati bali'pa leni lyabalongelwage, kwa mwanjaa bandu bangali Ayahudi baayalilwe kiloo bu'kana na Ayahudi. Kwa nyo na bembe bapalikwa tumya balaka yababile nayo kwa kitumbu sa kwayangatia Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Panaayomwa kulipanga likowe li' lya kwayangatia aumini aki'ba ba Yelusalemu, naatumbwa mwanja wangu' wo yenda Spania na nilu'a pi'tya kwinu. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Nitangite panga panaalu'a isa kwinu, naalu'a isa nibile na balaka yambone yaibu'ka kwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Bai mwaalongo bangu', nendakunnu'ba kwa lina lya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu na kwa upendo wa Loo Mpeleteu, mulu'mbane na nenga kwa kunilu'bya kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Mulu'be li'nga nipate kosopolelwa mumaboko ga balu' bangali u'bi'lya bababile Yudea, no bu'kana na utumisi wangu' upate yi'ki'ti'lwa na apeleteu ba akwo Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />li'nga Nnu'ngu' mana apendile niwese isa kasinu kwa mwoyo wo napusika na nenga nipu'mu'li pamope na mwenga. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Nnu'ngu' ywampeya amani abe pamope na mwenga mwaboti, Amina.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Salamu kwa bandu mbali'mbali'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Nipala mwatange dada bitu Foibe, ywembe ntumisi ywaaminika mulikanisa lya Kenkrea. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Nilu'ba mumpoki kwa kitumbu sa Bwana kati mwaipalikwa kwa bandu ba Nnu'ngu'. Mumpei sosoti si'lu' sapala bu'ka kasinu, mwanjaa ywembe apangite unogau muno kwa bandu baingi, na kasangu' kai'.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Mwasalimie Prisila na Akila, atumisi ayangu' mu Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Bembe baayi'ki'ti ata obeya bwu'mi wabe kwa kitumbu sangu'. Kwenda nenga bai lili nanaasukulu, ila ata makanisa goti ga bangali Ayahudi gendakwasukulu. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Salamu yangu' kai', kwa likanisa lyalikwembana munyumba yabe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Munsalimie na mbwiga lyangu' ywanimpendile Epaineto, ywembe ngaywaai nnongoi munkoa wa Asia kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Munsalimie Malia, ywaakasine muno panga kasi kwa kitumbu sinu. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Mwasalimie Androniko na Yunia, alongo bangu' babaabile muutabilwe pamope na nenga. Bembe baalongoli kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu kulikoni nenga, na bendalumbilwa muno nkati ya atumilwe.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Munsalimie Ampuliato, ywanimpendile mu Bwana Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Salamu yangu' imwiki Urbano, mpangakasi nnyangu' muutumisi wa Kilisitu, salamu yangu' kai' kwa mbwiga lyangu' Staku. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Munsalimie Apele ywaapayilwe no laya ukweli wa imani yake kwa Kilisitu. Mwasalimie bandu boti ba munyumba ya Aristobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Munsalimie nnongo wangu' Herodioni. Mwasalimie bandu boti babatama munyumba ya Narkiso, babamwu'bi'lya Bwana Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Mwasalimie Trifaina na Trifosa, alwawa babapanga kasi ya Bwana kwo kasana, na mbwiga lyangu' ywanimpendile Persi, nnwawa ywi'ngi' ywaapangite kasi ya Bwana kwo kasana. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Munsalimie Rufo, mundu nkangamau muno mukasi ya Bwana, na mau' bake, bembe nga kati mau' bangu' kai'. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Mukaasalimie Asinkrito, Flegoni, Herme, Patroba, Herma na aumini boti bababile pamope nabo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Mwasalimie Filologo, Yulia, Nerea na dada bake, na Olimpa na apeleteu boti bababile pamope nabo.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Musalimiane mwabene na bene kwo laya upendo. Salamu kwinu bu'ka kwa makanisa goti ga Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu ya kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Mwaalongo bangu' ninkong'ondelya mwiili'ndi'le na bandu babaleta mataukano no bi'ka iku'balo nnu'ngi' yinu bu'kana na mayi'gano gamuyi'ganilwe. Bandu bo mwibi'ke kuutalu nabo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Bandu kati bo bantumikiali Bwana witu Kilisitu, ila bakota maminyikio gabe bene. Batumya milongelo inannoga no baya makowe gaganogelya li'nga kwaakonga bandu alalo. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kila mundu ayu'wine bu'kana no yu'wa kwinu kwa Bwana, na nenga nipulaike muno bu'kana na lyo. Ata nyo nipala mube na ikima muno kwo panga makowe manogau, pangali baa na lukoolo lwolwoti lwa ulau. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Nnu'ngu' ywa amani aalu'a kunni'bata Ibilisi pai' ya magu'lu' gako kiyu'ngu'ya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Ngu'ngu' ya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu ibe pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoteo mpangakasi nnyangu' endakunsalimia, nyinyonyo na alongo bangu' Lukio, na Yosani, na Sosipatro bendakunsalimia. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nenga na Tertio, nanibile na kalani wo andika balua yi', nendakunsalimia kwa lina lya Bwana. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayo mwenekaya wangu' endakunsalimia, kasake nga kwabakwembana aumini boti ba likanisa. Erasto, mmi'ka mabi'ko wa kilambo si', pamope na Kwarto, nnongo witu, bendakunsalimia. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Ngu'ngu' ya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu ibe pamope na mwenga, Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milongelo ya Pauli ya kunkwi'ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Nnu'ngu' akwi'yi'lwe, ywembe ngaywawesa kumpanga mwenga panga mwakangamala muimani yinu kwo pi'tya mu Abali Inannoga ya Yesu Kilisitu, yanaaialike kasinu. Abali yo patumbu yaatiiyilwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Lakini nambi'yambi' iyo yo iumukulilwe no tanganikwa kwo pi'tya Maandiko Mapeleteu ga alondoli, bu'kana na amuli ya Nnu'ngu' wa milele, li'nga mataipwa goti gawese kumwu'bi'lya na kunnyu'wa. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Kwa Nnu'ngu' ywabile kisake nga mwene ikima yoti, ywembe nga ywo kwi'yi'lwa milele kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>